@startuml
title UC-03 - Register Resource Definition
autonumber
actor "Platform Engineer" as PE
boundary ResourceDefinitionController as API
control ResourceDefinitionService as Service
entity ResourceDefinition as Validator
control DriverContractInspector as Inspector
database ResourceTypeRepository as TypeRepo
database ConnectionRepository as ConnectionRepo
database ResourceDefinitionRepository as DefinitionRepo

PE -> API: RegisterResourceDefinition(document, optional profile) [MS-01..MS-02]
API -> Service: RegisterResourceDefinition(ctx, command)
Service -> Validator: Validate() [MS-03, BR-07]
Validator --> Service: valid
note right of Validator
Missing or [] criteria is rejected.
Explicit {} is wildcard score 0.
end note
Service -> TypeRepo: ListResourceTypes(orgID) [MS-04]
TypeRepo --> Service: ResourceType
Service -> ConnectionRepo: GetConnection(connectionID) + READY/org check [MS-04]
ConnectionRepo --> Service: Connection
Service -> Service: validateReferences and provision rules [MS-05]
Service -> Inspector: Inspect(embedded module) [MS-07]
Inspector --> Service: DriverContract + fingerprint
Service -> DefinitionRepo: ListResourceDefinitions(orgID) [MS-06]
DefinitionRepo --> Service: no duplicate ID
Service -> DefinitionRepo: SaveResourceDefinition(orgID, definition) <<transaction>> [MS-08]
DefinitionRepo --> Service: ResourceDefinition
Service --> API: ResourceDefinition [MS-09]
API --> PE: Registered
note right of DefinitionRepo
Planning first filters by Definition profile,
then scores the five standard criteria.
end note
@enduml
